{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "World of blind",
    "steam_appid": 2604780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that simulates blind people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark game, you can discover different animals and natural environments through the sounds coming from the surroundings, and unlock related achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can simulate the movement of blind people, such as using a broom to move left and right in front of you to sense whether there are obstacles in front.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't like not being able to see anything, you can press the [Q] key on the keyboard to light a small torch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The size of the flame can be changed with the number in the lower right corner of the game. The larger the number, the larger the illuminated range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to open the game menu, you can press the [ESC] key on the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to get a mouse, you can press the [~] key on the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can press [Shift] to turn on the running mode, or press [ctrl] to turn on the slow movement mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the perspective of the game with the mouse wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can press [Alt] to lock the perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need to guide the direction, you can press [E].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more shortcuts, just open the main menu and click on the key settings to see them.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that simulates blind people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark game, you can discover different animals and natural environments through the sounds coming from the surroundings, and unlock related achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can simulate the movement of blind people, such as using a broom to move left and right in front of you to sense whether there are obstacles in front.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't like not being able to see anything, you can press the [Q] key on the keyboard to light a small torch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The size of the flame can be changed with the number in the lower right corner of the game. The larger the number, the larger the illuminated range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to open the game menu, you can press the [ESC] key on the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to get a mouse, you can press the [~] key on the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can press [Shift] to turn on the running mode, or press [ctrl] to turn on the slow movement mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the perspective of the game with the mouse wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can press [Alt] to lock the perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need to guide the direction, you can press [E].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more shortcuts, just open the main menu and click on the key settings to see them.</p>",
